{"duration": 76.8, "speech_start": 0.09, "speech_end": 76.32, "timing_mode": "pauses", "sentences": [{"text": "Copyright law is a made-up moral rule.", "heading": null, "para_end": false, "id": "s1", "start": 0.09, "end": 3.55, "pause_after": 0.35, "words": [{"n": "copyright", "t0": 0.09, "t1": 0.817}, {"n": "law", "t0": 0.898, "t1": 1.14}, {"n": "is", "t0": 1.221, "t1": 1.383}, {"n": "a", "t0": 1.463, "t1": 1.544}, {"n": "made-up", "t0": 1.625, "t1": 2.191}, {"n": "moral", "t0": 2.271, "t1": 2.675}, {"n": "rule", "t0": 2.756, "t1": 3.16}], "soft_cut": false}, {"text": "Not made-up as in useless—made-up as in invented by statute, not discovered in the moral order.", "heading": null, "para_end": true, "id": "s2", "start": 3.9, "end": 9.51, "pause_after": 0.69, "words": [{"n": "not", "t0": 3.9, "t1": 4.054}, {"n": "made-up", "t0": 4.105, "t1": 4.464}, {"n": "as", "t0": 4.515, "t1": 4.618}, {"n": "in", "t0": 4.669, "t1": 4.771}, {"n": "uselessmade-up", "t0": 4.823, "t1": 5.592}, {"n": "as", "t0": 5.643, "t1": 5.745}, {"n": "in", "t0": 5.797, "t1": 5.899}, {"n": "invented", "t0": 5.951, "t1": 6.361}, {"n": "by", "t0": 6.412, "t1": 6.514}, {"n": "statute", "t0": 6.566, "t1": 7.376}, {"n": "not", "t0": 7.427, "t1": 7.581}, {"n": "discovered", "t0": 7.632, "t1": 8.145}, {"n": "in", "t0": 8.196, "t1": 8.299}, {"n": "the", "t0": 8.35, "t1": 8.504}, {"n": "moral", "t0": 8.555, "t1": 8.811}, {"n": "order", "t0": 8.862, "t1": 9.17}], "soft_cut": false}, {"text": "The Seventh Commandment forbids theft; it does not forbid copying.", "heading": null, "para_end": false, "id": "s3", "start": 10.2, "end": 13.66, "pause_after": 0.36, "words": [{"n": "the", "t0": 10.2, "t1": 10.342}, {"n": "seventh", "t0": 10.39, "t1": 10.722}, {"n": "commandment", "t0": 10.769, "t1": 11.291}, {"n": "forbids", "t0": 11.338, "t1": 11.67}, {"n": "theft", "t0": 11.718, "t1": 12.332}, {"n": "it", "t0": 12.38, "t1": 12.474}, {"n": "does", "t0": 12.522, "t1": 12.712}, {"n": "not", "t0": 12.759, "t1": 12.901}, {"n": "forbid", "t0": 12.949, "t1": 13.233}, {"n": "copying", "t0": 13.281, "t1": 13.66}], "soft_cut": false}, {"text": "You can take a man's ox, and that's theft.", "heading": null, "para_end": false, "id": "s4", "start": 14.02, "end": 16.1, "pause_after": 0.32, "words": [{"n": "you", "t0": 14.02, "t1": 14.169}, {"n": "can", "t0": 14.218, "t1": 14.367}, {"n": "take", "t0": 14.416, "t1": 14.614}, {"n": "a", "t0": 14.664, "t1": 14.713}, {"n": "man's", "t0": 14.763, "t1": 15.01}, {"n": "ox", "t0": 15.06, "t1": 15.209}, {"n": "and", "t0": 15.258, "t1": 15.407}, {"n": "that's", "t0": 15.456, "t1": 15.753}, {"n": "theft", "t0": 15.803, "t1": 16.1}], "soft_cut": false}, {"text": "You can learn his song and sing it, and the ox is still there.", "heading": null, "para_end": true, "id": "s5", "start": 16.42, "end": 19.7, "pause_after": 0.76, "words": [{"n": "you", "t0": 16.42, "t1": 16.55}, {"n": "can", "t0": 16.593, "t1": 16.723}, {"n": "learn", "t0": 16.766, "t1": 16.982}, {"n": "his", "t0": 17.025, "t1": 17.155}, {"n": "song", "t0": 17.198, "t1": 17.371}, {"n": "and", "t0": 17.414, "t1": 17.544}, {"n": "sing", "t0": 17.587, "t1": 17.76}, {"n": "it", "t0": 17.803, "t1": 18.223}, {"n": "and", "t0": 18.266, "t1": 18.396}, {"n": "the", "t0": 18.439, "t1": 18.569}, {"n": "ox", "t0": 18.612, "t1": 18.698}, {"n": "is", "t0": 18.742, "t1": 18.828}, {"n": "still", "t0": 18.871, "t1": 19.087}, {"n": "there", "t0": 19.131, "t1": 19.39}], "soft_cut": false}, {"text": "Copyright is a government-granted monopoly—a privilege created to incentivize production, not a natural right rooted in creation.", "heading": null, "para_end": false, "id": "s6", "start": 20.46, "end": 27.9, "pause_after": 0.65, "words": [{"n": "copyright", "t0": 20.46, "t1": 20.909}, {"n": "is", "t0": 20.958, "t1": 21.058}, {"n": "a", "t0": 21.108, "t1": 21.158}, {"n": "government-granted", "t0": 21.208, "t1": 22.105}, {"n": "monopolya", "t0": 22.155, "t1": 22.653}, {"n": "privilege", "t0": 22.703, "t1": 23.152}, {"n": "created", "t0": 23.201, "t1": 23.55}, {"n": "to", "t0": 23.6, "t1": 23.7}, {"n": "incentivize", "t0": 23.75, "t1": 24.298}, {"n": "production", "t0": 24.348, "t1": 25.216}, {"n": "not", "t0": 25.266, "t1": 25.416}, {"n": "a", "t0": 25.465, "t1": 25.515}, {"n": "natural", "t0": 25.565, "t1": 25.914}, {"n": "right", "t0": 25.964, "t1": 26.213}, {"n": "rooted", "t0": 26.263, "t1": 26.562}, {"n": "in", "t0": 26.612, "t1": 26.712}, {"n": "creation", "t0": 26.761, "t1": 27.21}], "soft_cut": false}, {"text": "It has terms, exceptions, compulsory licenses, and expiration dates because it is policy, not morality.", "heading": null, "para_end": false, "id": "s7", "start": 28.55, "end": 35.83, "pause_after": 0.32, "words": [{"n": "it", "t0": 28.55, "t1": 28.663}, {"n": "has", "t0": 28.719, "t1": 28.888}, {"n": "terms", "t0": 28.944, "t1": 29.552}, {"n": "exceptions", "t0": 29.608, "t1": 30.548}, {"n": "compulsory", "t0": 30.604, "t1": 31.167}, {"n": "licenses", "t0": 31.223, "t1": 32.03}, {"n": "and", "t0": 32.087, "t1": 32.256}, {"n": "expiration", "t0": 32.312, "t1": 32.875}, {"n": "dates", "t0": 32.931, "t1": 33.213}, {"n": "because", "t0": 33.269, "t1": 33.663}, {"n": "it", "t0": 33.72, "t1": 33.832}, {"n": "is", "t0": 33.889, "t1": 34.001}, {"n": "policy", "t0": 34.057, "t1": 34.742}, {"n": "not", "t0": 34.798, "t1": 34.967}, {"n": "morality", "t0": 35.023, "t1": 35.53}], "soft_cut": false}, {"text": "That is positive law, and positive law can be wise or foolish.", "heading": null, "para_end": true, "id": "s8", "start": 36.15, "end": 39.87, "pause_after": 0.73, "words": [{"n": "that", "t0": 36.15, "t1": 36.351}, {"n": "is", "t0": 36.401, "t1": 36.501}, {"n": "positive", "t0": 36.551, "t1": 36.953}, {"n": "law", "t0": 37.003, "t1": 37.533}, {"n": "and", "t0": 37.584, "t1": 37.734}, {"n": "positive", "t0": 37.784, "t1": 38.185}, {"n": "law", "t0": 38.236, "t1": 38.386}, {"n": "can", "t0": 38.436, "t1": 38.587}, {"n": "be", "t0": 38.637, "t1": 38.737}, {"n": "wise", "t0": 38.787, "t1": 38.988}, {"n": "or", "t0": 39.038, "t1": 39.139}, {"n": "foolish", "t0": 39.189, "t1": 39.59}], "soft_cut": false}, {"text": "We treat infringement as \"piracy\" and \"stealing,\" but that's marketing.", "heading": null, "para_end": false, "id": "s9", "start": 40.6, "end": 44.67, "pause_after": 0.33, "words": [{"n": "we", "t0": 40.6, "t1": 40.695}, {"n": "treat", "t0": 40.742, "t1": 40.98}, {"n": "infringement", "t0": 41.027, "t1": 41.597}, {"n": "as", "t0": 41.644, "t1": 41.739}, {"n": "piracy", "t0": 41.787, "t1": 42.166}, {"n": "and", "t0": 42.214, "t1": 42.356}, {"n": "stealing", "t0": 42.404, "t1": 43.296}, {"n": "but", "t0": 43.343, "t1": 43.486}, {"n": "that's", "t0": 43.533, "t1": 43.818}, {"n": "marketing", "t0": 43.865, "t1": 44.34}], "soft_cut": false}, {"text": "Calling a thing stealing doesn't make it so.", "heading": null, "para_end": false, "id": "s10", "start": 45.0, "end": 47.04, "pause_after": 0.83, "words": [{"n": "calling", "t0": 45.0, "t1": 45.325}, {"n": "a", "t0": 45.371, "t1": 45.417}, {"n": "thing", "t0": 45.464, "t1": 45.695}, {"n": "stealing", "t0": 45.742, "t1": 46.113}, {"n": "doesn't", "t0": 46.159, "t1": 46.484}, {"n": "make", "t0": 46.53, "t1": 46.715}, {"n": "it", "t0": 46.762, "t1": 46.855}, {"n": "so", "t0": 46.901, "t1": 47.04}], "soft_cut": false}, {"text": "If copyright were intrinsically immoral to violate, the rules would not change every few decades or differ by country.", "heading": null, "para_end": true, "id": "s11", "start": 47.87, "end": 54.04, "pause_after": 0.72, "words": [{"n": "if", "t0": 47.87, "t1": 47.963}, {"n": "copyright", "t0": 48.009, "t1": 48.426}, {"n": "were", "t0": 48.473, "t1": 48.658}, {"n": "intrinsically", "t0": 48.704, "t1": 49.307}, {"n": "immoral", "t0": 49.353, "t1": 49.678}, {"n": "to", "t0": 49.724, "t1": 49.817}, {"n": "violate", "t0": 49.863, "t1": 50.654}, {"n": "the", "t0": 50.701, "t1": 50.84}, {"n": "rules", "t0": 50.886, "t1": 51.118}, {"n": "would", "t0": 51.164, "t1": 51.396}, {"n": "not", "t0": 51.442, "t1": 51.581}, {"n": "change", "t0": 51.628, "t1": 51.906}, {"n": "every", "t0": 51.952, "t1": 52.184}, {"n": "few", "t0": 52.23, "t1": 52.369}, {"n": "decades", "t0": 52.416, "t1": 52.74}, {"n": "or", "t0": 52.787, "t1": 52.879}, {"n": "differ", "t0": 52.926, "t1": 53.204}, {"n": "by", "t0": 53.25, "t1": 53.343}, {"n": "country", "t0": 53.389, "t1": 53.76}], "soft_cut": false}, {"text": "The real moral duties are: don't defraud, don't plagiarize, honor contracts, and don't claim another's work as your own.", "heading": null, "para_end": false, "id": "s12", "start": 54.76, "end": 60.45, "pause_after": 0.33, "words": [{"n": "the", "t0": 54.76, "t1": 54.875}, {"n": "real", "t0": 54.913, "t1": 55.066}, {"n": "moral", "t0": 55.104, "t1": 55.295}, {"n": "duties", "t0": 55.334, "t1": 55.563}, {"n": "are", "t0": 55.602, "t1": 56.114}, {"n": "don't", "t0": 56.153, "t1": 56.344}, {"n": "defraud", "t0": 56.382, "t1": 57.098}, {"n": "don't", "t0": 57.136, "t1": 57.328}, {"n": "plagiarize", "t0": 57.366, "t1": 57.787}, {"n": "honor", "t0": 57.825, "t1": 58.016}, {"n": "contracts", "t0": 58.054, "t1": 58.767}, {"n": "and", "t0": 58.805, "t1": 58.92}, {"n": "don't", "t0": 58.958, "t1": 59.15}, {"n": "claim", "t0": 59.188, "t1": 59.379}, {"n": "another's", "t0": 59.417, "t1": 59.761}, {"n": "work", "t0": 59.8, "t1": 59.953}, {"n": "as", "t0": 59.991, "t1": 60.068}, {"n": "your", "t0": 60.106, "t1": 60.259}, {"n": "own", "t0": 60.297, "t1": 60.45}], "soft_cut": false}, {"text": "Those are commanded.", "heading": null, "para_end": false, "id": "s13", "start": 60.78, "end": 62.3, "pause_after": 0.37, "words": [{"n": "those", "t0": 60.78, "t1": 61.068}, {"n": "are", "t0": 61.125, "t1": 61.298}, {"n": "commanded", "t0": 61.355, "t1": 61.93}], "soft_cut": false}, {"text": "The rest is a legal bargain dressed in moral clothing.", "heading": null, "para_end": true, "id": "s14", "start": 62.67, "end": 65.2, "pause_after": 0.67, "words": [{"n": "the", "t0": 62.67, "t1": 62.794}, {"n": "rest", "t0": 62.835, "t1": 63.0}, {"n": "is", "t0": 63.042, "t1": 63.124}, {"n": "a", "t0": 63.166, "t1": 63.207}, {"n": "legal", "t0": 63.248, "t1": 63.455}, {"n": "bargain", "t0": 63.496, "t1": 63.785}, {"n": "dressed", "t0": 63.826, "t1": 64.115}, {"n": "in", "t0": 64.157, "t1": 64.239}, {"n": "moral", "t0": 64.281, "t1": 64.487}, {"n": "clothing", "t0": 64.528, "t1": 64.9}], "soft_cut": false}, {"text": "The state may grant limited monopolies; it cannot manufacture sin.", "heading": null, "para_end": false, "id": "s15", "start": 65.87, "end": 69.74, "pause_after": 0.31, "words": [{"n": "the", "t0": 65.87, "t1": 66.03}, {"n": "state", "t0": 66.083, "t1": 66.349}, {"n": "may", "t0": 66.402, "t1": 66.561}, {"n": "grant", "t0": 66.615, "t1": 66.88}, {"n": "limited", "t0": 66.934, "t1": 67.306}, {"n": "monopolies", "t0": 67.359, "t1": 68.304}, {"n": "it", "t0": 68.357, "t1": 68.464}, {"n": "cannot", "t0": 68.517, "t1": 68.836}, {"n": "manufacture", "t0": 68.889, "t1": 69.474}, {"n": "sin", "t0": 69.527, "t1": 69.74}], "soft_cut": false}, {"text": "So stop baptizing statutory monopolies as righteousness.", "heading": null, "para_end": false, "id": "s16", "start": 70.05, "end": 73.06, "pause_after": 0.32, "words": [{"n": "so", "t0": 70.05, "t1": 70.157}, {"n": "stop", "t0": 70.211, "t1": 70.426}, {"n": "baptizing", "t0": 70.48, "t1": 70.964}, {"n": "statutory", "t0": 71.017, "t1": 71.501}, {"n": "monopolies", "t0": 71.555, "t1": 72.093}, {"n": "as", "t0": 72.146, "t1": 72.254}, {"n": "righteousness", "t0": 72.308, "t1": 73.06}], "soft_cut": false}, {"text": "Copyright may be prudent.", "heading": null, "para_end": false, "id": "s17", "start": 73.38, "end": 74.66, "pause_after": 0.78, "words": [{"n": "copyright", "t0": 73.38, "t1": 73.841}, {"n": "may", "t0": 73.892, "t1": 74.046}, {"n": "be", "t0": 74.097, "t1": 74.199}, {"n": "prudent", "t0": 74.25, "t1": 74.66}], "soft_cut": false}, {"text": "It is not holy.", "heading": null, "para_end": true, "id": "s18", "start": 75.44, "end": 76.32, "pause_after": 0.0, "words": [{"n": "it", "t0": 75.44, "t1": 75.557}, {"n": "is", "t0": 75.616, "t1": 75.733}, {"n": "not", "t0": 75.792, "t1": 75.968}, {"n": "holy", "t0": 76.027, "t1": 76.32}], "soft_cut": false}], "chapters": [{"from": "s1", "to": "s18", "id": "ch01", "start": 0.0, "end": 76.8}]}